そうですが、別ファイル(module)扱いになります。

```import { TimeoutError as TimeoutError1 } from "<https://deno.land/x/msgpack_rpc@v3.1.1/response_waiter.ts#~>";
import { TimeoutError as TimeoutError2 } from "<https://deno.land/x/msgpack_rpc@v3.1.1/response_waiter.ts#>^";
import { TimeoutError as TimeoutError3 } from "<https://deno.land/x/msgpack_rpc@v3.1.1/response_waiter.ts>";

console.log(TimeoutError1 === TimeoutError2); // false
console.log(TimeoutError2 === TimeoutError3); // false
console.log(TimeoutError3 === TimeoutError1); // false```
